7bac-926f-4942-b019-6e37afd1b279",1,"8c882626-6852-430e-9f88-a23c1bb3ce00",1,"INTERFACE (ITcVnContainer)"],[20,"a6ff135a-e8d5-4183-a23f-05541a8f87ba",1,"8c882626-6852-430e-9f88-a23c1bb3ce00",2,"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)"],[22,"8c882626-6852-430e-9f88-a23c1bb3ce00",1,"a90e541a-2019-4001-8254-af44f7c50319",1,"INTERFACE (ITcVnImage)"],[23,"a5796327-75c9-480d-8cbc-9567f81c5b21",1,"1864520c-4667-4e13-98ac-de72eb88d061",3,"ALIAS (TcVnVector4_LREAL),ARRAY (ARRAY [0..3] OF LREAL)"],[24,"529e6228-146f-488f-9505-8e63cf13e742",1,"a6ff135a-e8d5-4183-a23f-05541a8f87ba",3,"ALIAS (TcVnVector4_LREAL),ARRAY (ARRAY [0..3] OF LREAL)"],[25,"d0441d51-c288-42d2-af00-67986b1dcdf0",1,"8c882626-6852-430e-9f88-a23c1bb3ce00",3,"ALIAS (TcVnVector4_LREAL),ARRAY (ARRAY [0..3] OF LREAL)"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":"1. Find every washer","bounding":[584,41.29999542236328,2047.50390625,657.6000366210938],"color":"#3f789e","font_size":24,"flags":{},"description":"A light blur, then F_VN_HoughCirclesExp finds each washer's outer edge. It returns a container of circles in detection order, each element [x, y, radius]. nMinRadius (25) is bigger than any centre hole, so the holes are not reported as washers."},{"id":2,"title":"2. Sort by size (F_VN_SortContainer)","bounding":[2064.40234375,769.300048828125,1071.54541015625,832.5999755859375],"color":"#3f789e","font_size":24,"flags":{},"description":"F_VN_SortContainer orders a container by one field of its elements. nSortByElemIdx = 2 sorts by the radius; GREATER puts the largest first, LESS the smallest. After sorting, element 0 is the answer, so no search loop is needed. Use nSortByElemIdx 0 or 1 to sort left-to-right or top-to-bottom instead."},{"id":3,"title":"3. Draw the result","bounding":[1304,1673.10009765625,1565.974609375,411.6001281738281],"color":"#3f789e","font_size":24,"flags":{},"description":"Every washer outlined in yellow; element 0 of each sorted container drawn thick: the largest in green, the smallest in red. Colours come from the Vision/Constants RGBA_* nodes."}],"config":{},"extra":{"filemeta":{"name":"Sort Washers by Size with SortContainer","description":"This example finds every washer on a tray and picks out the largest and smallest using F_VN_SortContainer.\n\nSet nSortByElemIdx to 0 or 1 to sort left-to-right or top-to-bottom instead, for example to pick parts in order along a conveyor.","tags":["Pick and Place","Robotics","Size Classification"]},"__aiIds":{"06f1da47-13b9-462a-aeba-9f78e3fe24df":"img","524ecfe6-0f65-4c07-ad3c-0dfd2071921e":"blur","833c82b8-ec3b-4cc2-a182-41d0d1500054":"hough","fdea521f-7a62-4571-8637-f5a9b6095fa6":"count","6afd3360-f026-44f5-b7fc-18367c663a0b":"showCount","c8914544-fa6b-43bf-8652-5bdc910cac1e":"desc","cf1b7bac-926f-4942-b019-6e37afd1b279":"asc","3b150d2f-52f7-48cb-ae50-acfe114c344b":"showSorted","3db679f0-44e6-4d35-b645-9b3293f0c2fc":"big","48a196a0-d588-42c8-8401-ff631e9ef94b":"small","90848057-e4f0-4da7-9cfb-0419cbd724b5":"showBig","312589d4-a574-46a0-aa7d-cd7c58dea3d1":"showSmall","668f2667-5c7e-4c25-ba15-3b0206f902fd":"rgb","6b5c6c43-9f5a-4cd8-a412-194f9734175f":"yellow","8bdbb77d-67f8-42bf-8bb9-30f6db77da27":"green","bb95c7cd-6916-4afd-af88-9e4120fb8449":"red","1864520c-4667-4e13-98ac-de72eb88d061":"drawAll","a6ff135a-e8d5-4183-a23f-05541a8f87ba":"drawBig","8c882626-6852-430e-9f88-a23c1bb3ce00":"drawSmall","a90e541a-2019-4001-8254-af44f7c50319":"out","a5796327-75c9-480d-8cbc-9567f81c5b21":"yellow","529e6228-146f-488f-9505-8e63cf13e742":"green","d0441d51-c288-42d2-af00-67986b1dcdf0":"red"},"annotations_plugin":[],"ds":{"scale":0.35049389948139253,"offset":[331.60860680320104,137.9660066902437]}},"version":0.4,"uuid":"1b8236e8-1574-4213-b77d-f52323b1e885"}